sequenceDiagram
    participant usr_employee as "Employee"
    participant ui_app as "mobile-app (Compose)"
    participant svc_api as "api (FastAPI)"
    participant db_postgres as "PostgreSQL"
    ui_app->>svc_api: protected call while S-02 S-03 or S-04 waits - e.g. GET /api/incidents - Authorization Bearer JWT
    svc_api-->>ui_app: 401 detail No autenticado - token expired malformed or invalidly signed
    Note over ui_app: NO silent retry - no refresh mechanism exists (Q-008) - clear the Keystore token (CONF-002, BR-005)
    ui_app-->>usr_employee: route to S-01 - interrupted action not auto-resumed
    usr_employee->>ui_app: re-enter credentials on S-01
    ui_app->>svc_api: POST /api/auth/login
    alt valid credentials
        svc_api-->>ui_app: 200 new access_token JWT - 8 h session
        ui_app-->>usr_employee: restart at S-02 with fresh list load
    else re-authentication fails (e.g. account deactivated)
        svc_api-->>ui_app: 401 detail Credenciales inválidas
        ui_app-->>usr_employee: generic inline error on S-01 (BR-002)
    end
    Note over ui_app,svc_api: network errors must NOT trigger this flow - only a real 401 ends the session (CONF-009)
